  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8[b]">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ger">Ger</ref> 8[b]</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="8[b]" corresp="#wit-b">[8[b]] huru is mæst neod, þæt he asece, hu he yrde mæge fyrme geforðian, ðonne ðæs tima sy.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#gobbitt" n="23.1" corresp="#wit-b">Huru is mæst neod þæt he asece hu he yrde mæge fyrme geforðian ðonne ðæs tima sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#gobbitt" corresp="#wit-b">At the least, it is most desirable that he learns how he may cultivate the land [and] what he should do when it is the right time.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">namentlich ist zumeist nöthig, dass er erforsche, wie er den Boden durch Bearbeitung fördern könne, wenn der Zeitpunkt dafür ist.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">above all it is most necessary that he find out how he can further the land by tillage, when the time for it comes.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann asks whether the author means ‘yrðe’ as ‘ploughing’, as in 10. Compare 1 f.</note>
      </div>
    </body>
